  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tu cherches Nivis, il n’est pas là.\nMais du coup, c’est l’occasion parfaite...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... pour te lancer un défi, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E00200070006F007500720020007400650020006C0061006E00630065007200200075006E0020006400E900660069002C002000100002010000000020002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En l’absence de Nivis, c’est à moi de prendre\nles initiatives nécessaires pour m’améliorer !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je te laisse du temps pour te préparer au duel.\nViens me parler quand ton équipe sera prête !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est pour notre duel ? Ou est-ce que tu as besoin\nde moi pour une capacité Plus ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour le duel !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F007500720020006C00650020006400750065006C002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour une capacité Plus...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0075007200200075006E00650020006300610070006100630069007400E900200050006C00750073002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Finalement, je n’ai besoin de rien.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460069006E0061006C0065006D0065006E0074002C0020006A00650020006E2019006100690020006200650073006F0069006E0020006400650020007200690065006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hum, je suis sûre que tu as beaucoup de choses\nà faire, de ton côté...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Montre-moi ce que vaut un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿଉ Dresseure Dresseuse\nqui a atteint le rang A au Royale Z-A !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est pour le duel ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200070006F007500720020006C00650020006400750065006C0020003F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu es vraiment l<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāea Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse l<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāea plus fort<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe\nde tout Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors que moi, en comparaison...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F0072007300200071007500650020006D006F0069002C00200065006E00200063006F006D007000610072006100690073006F006E002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... je stagne.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E0020006A006500200073007400610067006E0065002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne mérite pas de faire partie des Poings de la\nJustice... ni de me présenter devant Nivis...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ma seule présence est une insulte aux autres\nmembres...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610020007300650075006C006500200070007200E900730065006E00630065002000650073007400200075006E006500200069006E00730075006C0074006500200061007500780020006100750074007200650073000A006D0065006D0062007200650073002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "DARBAAAR !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044004100520042004100410041005200200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "BARDAAAR !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042004100520044004100410041005200200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, non ! C’est les deux Pandarbare !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020006E006F006E002000210020004320190065007300740020006C0065007300200064006500750078002000500061006E00640061007200620061007200650020002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ces deux-là passent leur temps en dehors\ndes zones sauvages à semer le chaos !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ils sont très dangereux, même Nivis a du mal\nà les repousser sans encombre !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais il n’est pas là, en ce moment...\nJe suis la seule à pouvoir protéger le dojo !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ! Donne-moi un coup de main,\ns’il te plaît !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020002100200044006F006E006E0065002D006D006F006900200075006E00200063006F007500700020006400650020006D00610069006E002C000A007320190069006C00200074006500200070006C006100EE00740020002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien joué !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E0020006A006F007500E90020002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dar ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006100720020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh, vous deux ! La sortie, c’est par là-bas !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450068002C00200076006F0075007300200064006500750078002000210020004C006100200073006F0072007400690065002C00200063201900650073007400200070006100720020006C00E0002D0062006100730020002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... Nivis !!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E0020004E0069007600690073002000210021002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ? Germaine ?\nÉtait-ce encore ces deux Pandarbare ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020003F0020004700650072006D00610069006E00650020003F000A00C90074006100690074002D0063006500200065006E0063006F00720065002000630065007300200064006500750078002000500061006E00640061007200620061007200650020003F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui ! Ils ont essayé de mettre à sac le dojo, mais\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> et moi les avons repoussés !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿਉe sauveura sauveuse d’Illumis n’a pas volé sa réputation.\nJ’ai pu ressentir toute sa puissance, aujourd’hui.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 119
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et voir à quel point je suis nulle à côté...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200076006F00690072002000E00020007100750065006C00200070006F0069006E00740020006A0065002000730075006900730020006E0075006C006C0065002000E00020006300F4007400E9002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Germaine.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700650072006D00610069006E0065002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F007500690020003F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tu avais été nulle, tu crois que tu aurais pu\nte battre aux côtés <U+0010><U+0003>ᐈ<U+0000><U+0001><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si j’ai pu m’absenter, c’est parce que je savais que\nje laissais le dojo entre de bonnes mains.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Reconnaître la distance qui te sépare du sommet\nmontre que tu es consciente de tes faiblesses.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais n’ignore pas ta force ! Tu as encore\nun long chemin devant toi. La prochaine fois,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\non repoussera les Pandarbare ensemble !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À... à vos ordres !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C0002E002E002E002000E000200076006F00730020006F007200640072006500730020002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ! Merci pour tout ce que\ntu as fait aujourd’hui !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 4896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002000210020004D006500720063006900200070006F0075007200200074006F007500740020006300650020007100750065000A0074007500200061007300200066006100690074002000610075006A006F00750072006420190068007500690020002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
